\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{What does a continuum boundary term measure?}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{On a finite grid \ref{fdip-01B9} places both arguments of the correction at sites adjacent to the cut. The inverse in that correction still samples the whole eliminated region, as \ref{fdip-01BA} shows. The continuum Atiyah-Patodi-Singer formula on a four-dimensional manifold uses a boundary Dirac operator in addition to a bulk integral (\citet{p. 2, Eq. (3)}{fukaya2020lattice}). Which operator and boundary condition enter the proposed lattice comparison?}
